abstract: "A runnable miniature of the Sn zeolite question: Sn in CHA as closed, open (hydrolysed) and hydrated sites, a foundation model screen, molecular dynamics, well tempered metadynamics on a coordination number, and GIPAW 119Sn shifts weighted by the populations. Free software only."
keywords:
